  ) : (
    <>
      <p>
        Most of my time now goes into three kinds of software, mostly written in modern C++ and Go: system tools,
        telemetry and messaging platforms, and algorithm-driven applications. The{' '}
        <a href={projects} class={ui.inlineLink}>projects page</a> has the full list; two examples follow.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href={asion} class={ui.inlineLink}>Asion</a>, which I started in 2024, is a privacy-first productivity and
        activity tracker for macOS, Linux and Windows, built with self-hosting in mind. It rests on native OS event
        hooks, a lightweight daemon architecture and gRPC between its components, and is in early access.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href={novacast} class={ui.inlineLink}>Novacast</a> began in 2025 at a computer company where I worked, as a
